{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d4af56bb-6950-88f8-98b4-5f71a239c4eb",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T09:56:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Frank Cirelli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:54:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:54:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. I am calling about the snow on my street. It was not plowed since the storm. The one with the snow and then the rain, Sunday and Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:54:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the street hasn't been plowed at all since that storm on Sunday and Monday. Which street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:54:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Chapel Street. I am at 198 Chapel Street, in the Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:54:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "198 Chapel Street. Got it. And when you say not plowed, has a truck come through at all, even once, or nothing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:54:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing, I think. The snow is there, and then it got heavy with the rain, and now it is frozen, very hard. The cars pass very slow, and it is rough in the middle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:55:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that happens with a snow-to-rain mix. It turns into that heavy crust when it freezes overnight. So you'd like a plow to come back through the street. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:55:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. I ask that one plow come back, please. If I say it right, you send a truck to my street again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:55:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm putting in a request for a crew to go back to Chapel Street, so it's on their list. I can't promise it's today, but the request goes in this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:55:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. I understand. Maybe today or maybe tomorrow, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:55:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's about right. Sometime in the next day or so, depending on how the other streets go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:55:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I moved here from Connecticut one year ago, and I like it very much here. Just this time, the street is a little difficult."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:55:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, glad you like it. Let me read it back. 198 Chapel Street, Historic Hill, no plowing since Sunday and Monday's storm, requesting a return pass. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:56:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:56:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want me to take a number in case somebody needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:56:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:56:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0194. Okay, Mr. Cirelli, you're all set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:56:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T09:56:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
